{
  "base": "<p class="mb-4 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">חברו את הטפסים באתר שלכם כדי שכל פנייה תיכנס כליד. אחרי החיבור אפשר לבנות על זה אוטומציות.</p><div class="grid gap-4"><div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 grid gap-4 content-start"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-7 bg-gray-900 shrink-0 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/globe.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/globe.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark truncate">האתר שלי</h3></div><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs " style="background-color:var(--color-success-bg);color:var(--color-success-text);border-color:var(--color-success-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1.5 " style="background-color:var(--color-success-dot)"></span>מחובר</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">מאפשר אוטומציות על: נשלח טופס באתר</p><ul class="grid gap-3"><li class="grid gap-2 rounded-md border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">האתר של דנה</span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] leading-tight " style="background-color:var(--color-error-bg);color:var(--color-error-text);border-color:var(--color-error-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1 " style="background-color:var(--color-error-dot)"></span>מנותק</span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] leading-tight " style="background-color:var(--color-error-bg);color:var(--color-error-text);border-color:var(--color-error-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1 " style="background-color:var(--color-error-dot)"></span>החיבור נותק</span></span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">החיבור אינו פעיל.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">0 מקורות · אוטומציה אחת · פעילות אחרונה לפני 9 ימים</p><p class="text-sm text-red-600" role="alert">האוטומציות שמשתמשות בחיבור הזה מסומנות כדורשות טיפול.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/eye.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/eye.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>פרטים</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>יצירת חיבור</span></button></div></li><li class="grid gap-2 rounded-md border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">אתר הקורסים</span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] leading-tight " style="background-color:var(--color-error-bg);color:var(--color-error-text);border-color:var(--color-error-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1 " style="background-color:var(--color-error-dot)"></span>פניות נדחות</span></span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">מגיעות פניות לחיבור הזה אבל הן לא נכנסות למערכת.</p><div class="grid gap-2 rounded-md border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-3" role="alert"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-900">יש בעיה בחיבור לטופס באתר</p><p class="text-sm text-red-800">התקבל ניסיון לשלוח ליד מהטופס באתר שלך, אבל החיבור לא אומת ולכן הליד לא נכנס למערכת.</p></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">2 מקורות · 0 אוטומציות · אירוע אחרון לפני 5 שעות</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/eye.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/eye.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>פרטים</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>יצירת חיבור חדש</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/link-slash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/link-slash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>ניתוק</span></button></div></li></ul></div></div>",
